/T (To ensure high reliability, low power consumption, and modularity, the Emergency SOS circuit is partitioned into five distinct functional blocks: \(1\) Power Management & Regulation, \(2\) Motion Sensing & Fall Detection, \(3\) Central Processing & Wireless Telemetry, \(4\) Acoustic & Visual Annunciation, and \(5\) Display & User Interfaces.)
/E (To ensure high reliability, low power consumption, and modularity, the Emergency SOS circuit is partitioned into five distinct functional blocks: \(1\) Power Management & Regulation, \(2\) Motion Sensing & Fall Detection, \(3\) Central Processing & Wireless Telemetry, \(4\) Acoustic & Visual Annunciation, and \(5\) Display & User Interfaces.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
