/T (2. Electrical Rules Checker \(ERC\) Compliance: Dedicated PWR_FLAG symbols are placed on the +3.3V and GND nets in the power supply section. In KiCad, ERC verifies that every power net has an authorized power driver. The presence of these flags informs the ERC engine that the TPS63001 VOUT and PGND pins supply power to the nets, eliminating false 'pin not driven' warnings.)
