/T (1. Western Zone \(User Interface & Connectors\): Houses the distress push-button \(SW1\), the JST battery connector \(P1\), and the tri-color LED status cluster \(D1, D2, D3 with resistors R5, R6, R7\). Positioning P1 at the left edge guarantees unobstructed cable entry. SW1 is easily accessible by the user's thumb, and the LEDs are aligned along the edge for clear panel visibility.)
/E (1. Western Zone \(User Interface & Connectors\): Houses the distress push-button \(SW1\), the JST battery connector \(P1\), and the tri-color LED status cluster \(D1, D2, D3 with resistors R5, R6, R7\). Positioning P1 at the left edge guarantees unobstructed cable entry. SW1 is easily accessible by the user's thumb, and the LEDs are aligned along the edge for clear panel visibility.)
