/T (3. Eastern Zone \(Microcontroller Core & RF Antenna\): The ESP32-WROOM-32 module \(U1\) occupies the eastern section. Critically, the integrated meandering inverted-F PCB antenna extends past the board's right edge into a dedicated Antenna Keep-Out Zone. The 4-pin OLED header \(J1\) is located at the bottom edge, allowing an external display ribbon to plug in without crossing the high-speed RF antenna.)
/E (3. Eastern Zone \(Microcontroller Core & RF Antenna\): The ESP32-WROOM-32 module \(U1\) occupies the eastern section. Critically, the integrated meandering inverted-F PCB antenna extends past the board's right edge into a dedicated Antenna Keep-Out Zone. The 4-pin OLED header \(J1\) is located at the bottom edge, allowing an external display ribbon to plug in without crossing the high-speed RF antenna.)
