/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 112 0 R
/T (The multi-drop I2C bus operates at 400 kHz \(Fast-Mode\), interconnecting the ESP32 host, MPU-6050 sensor, and external OLED display. To ensure clean square-wave edges and prevent rise-time degradation caused by parasitic capacitance, the I2C traces \(SDA and SCL\) are kept short and direct, running over an unbroken ground reference plane on the bottom layer. This provides controlled impedance and shields the high-sensitivity sensor data from switching noise.)
/E (The multi-drop I2C bus operates at 400 kHz \(Fast-Mode\), interconnecting the ESP32 host, MPU-6050 sensor, and external OLED display. To ensure clean square-wave edges and prevent rise-time degradation caused by parasitic capacitance, the I2C traces \(SDA and SCL\) are kept short and direct, running over an unbroken ground reference plane on the bottom layer. This provides controlled impedance and shields the high-sensitivity sensor data from switching noise.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
