960 0 obj
<<
/Title (The process of assigning footprints in Cvpcb highlighted how component package sizes directly dictate board density. Balancing the use of easily solderable 0805 passives with ultra-miniature fine-pitch ICs \(like the QFN-24 MPU-6050 and VSON-10 TPS63001\) demonstrated real-world trade-offs between board miniaturization and ease of assembly. During the layout phase, routing power traces with adequate copper width while preserving a low-impedance ground return plane taught me the practical importance of return current paths and high di/dt switching loop containment.)
/Dest [29 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 34 0 R
/Prev 727 0 R
/Next 728 0 R
>>
endobj
