1255 0 obj
<<
/Title (The primary objective of this hardware engineering project was to design, lay out, and verify a complete, production-ready printed circuit board \(PCB\) for a Smart Emergency SOS & Fall Detection IoT System. In vulnerable groups such as elderly individuals living independently, field workers in hazardous industrial environments, or solo adventurers, accidental falls and sudden physical distress require rapid medical intervention. This project converts an electronic schematic concept created in eSim into a compact, practical, and highly reliable two-layer wearable hardware unit.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1146 0 R
/Next 1356 0 R
>>
endobj
