/Title (As evidenced in Figure 8, the bottom surface of the PCB is entirely free of active surface-mount ICs or SMD passives. The only features penetrating through to the back layer are the solder pins of through-hole components \(J1, Q1, P1\) and via holes.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1258 0 R
/Next 1431 0 R
>>
