/Title (3. Hand-Solderable THT Pins: The through-hole pins of the JST connector \(P1\), OLED header \(J1\), and BC547 transistor \(Q1\) can be hand-soldered or wave-soldered after the top surface reflow is completed, ensuring rapid lab prototyping and straightforward rework.)
